## 🔍 Page Overview

The `/merchant` page serves as the **login and registration gateway** for merchants. It is a **static SvelteKit** page with client-side JavaScript handling form interactions.

---

## 🧱 Technology Stack (Confirmed)

| Component | Technology |

|-----------|------------|

| **Framework** | SvelteKit (static site generation) |

| **Hosting** | Vercel |

| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS (inferred from class names) |

| **Icons** | Lucide icons |

| **Client-side Logic** | SvelteKit client-side routing & form handling |

---

