| Element | Description |

|---------|-------------|

| **Header** | "Merchant Portal" title with login/register toggle buttons |

| **Login Form** | Email + Password fields + Privacy Policy checkbox |

| **Register Tab** | Toggle button for new merchant account (likely opens registration form) |

| **Footer Links** | "মূল ওয়েবসাইটে ফিরুন" (Back to main site) + "Privacy Policy" |

---

## 📝 Form Fields (Login)

| Field | Type | Placeholder | Required |

