## 📌 Summary

The `/merchant` page is a **static SvelteKit login/registration portal** that relies on client-side JavaScript to handle form submission. The actual authentication logic is handled by a **separate backend API** (not hosted on Vercel). No sensitive data or API endpoints are exposed in the client-side code.

